          "copyright": "℗ 2021 Walt Disney Records Motion Picture Artwork, TM & Copyright © 2023 Disney",
          "description": "Disney’s Encanto, features eight enchanting songs by Lin-Manuel Miranda and a spellbinding score by Germaine Franco. The music brings to life the magical Madrigal family, each member of which (except the plucky Mirabel) has a special power given by their ‘miracle.’ When the miracle is in peril, only Mirabel can save it.\n\nFeaturing songs that have already become timeless hits such as “We Don’t Talk About Bruno” , “Waiting For A Miracle” and “The Family Madrigal” - get ready to sing and dance along to these vibrant and joyous tunes. \n",
